e=\"Investigate the theft of camp supplies\">Investigate the theft of camp supplies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Danger!_Explosive!\" title=\"Danger! Explosive!\">Danger! Explosive!</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Misfortune_on_a_Workday\" title=\"Misfortune on a Workday\">Misfortune on a Workday</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wait_for_Godo\" title=\"Wait for Godo\">Wait for Godo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Photos_of_Jinzhou\" title=\"Photos of Jinzhou\">Photos of Jinzhou</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Silver-haired_Echo_Trainer_-_I\" title=\"Silver-haired Echo Trainer - I\">Silver-haired Echo Trainer - I</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Silver-haired_Echo_Trainer_-_II\" title=\"Silver-haired Echo Trainer - II\">Silver-haired Echo Trainer - II</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Silver-haired_Echo_Trainer_-_III\" title=\"Silver-haired Echo Trainer - III\">Silver-haired Echo Trainer - III</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/A_Taste_of_Everything\" title=\"A Taste of Everything\">A Taste of Everything</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lost_Ranger\" title=\"Lost Ranger\">Lost Ranger</a></li></ul>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>",
